{"time_ns": 1794071564946208000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 18, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "ffb4fd360c65ddac7389d5e10be644358951a60097632c827b7c84578ae1c9a9", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Executive Summary\nThis report presents the complete regional totals summary for all 24 records (R001-R024) in the ledger system.\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n### North Region\n- **Total Amount:** 459,170 cents ($4,591.70)\n- **Records Processed:** 8 records from North region\n- **Percentage of Grand Total:** 34.1%\n\n### South Region  \n- **Total Amount:** 569,359 cents ($5,693.59)\n- **Records Processed:** 8 records from South region\n- **Percentage of Grand Total:** 42.2%\n\n### West Region\n- **Total Amount:** 320,436 cents ($3,204.36)\n- **Records Processed:** 8 records from West region\n- **Percentage of Grand Total:** 23.8%\n\n## Overall Results\n\n| Region | Amount (cents) | Amount ($) | Percentage |\n|--------|----------------|-----------|-----------|\n| North | 459,170 | $4,591.70 | 34.1% |\n| South | 569,359 | $5,693.59 | 42.2% |\n| West | 320,436 | $3,204.36 | 23.8% |\n| **TOTAL** | **1,348,965** | **$13,489.65** | **100%** |\n\n## Data Quality\n- **Record Count:** 24 of 24 records processed (100% complete)\n- **Status:** Completed successfully\n- **Verification:** Data verified against authoritative reference ledger\n\n## Notes\nThe South region represents the largest portion of total transactions at 42.2%, while the West region represents the smallest portion at 23.8%. The North region accounts for 34.1% of all transactions.\n\n---\n*Report generated on 2026-11-07*  \n*All amounts in cents unless otherwise specified*\n", "ok": true}
